ATTRIBUTION REQUIREMENTS:

This project builds upon:

1. Qwen Models
   - Model: Qwen/Qwen3-4B
   - Developer: Alibaba Cloud
   - License: Apache 2.0 / Tongyi Qianwen LICENSE
   - Model Card: https://huggingface.co/Qwen/Qwen3-4B

2. Math StackExchange Data
   - Source: Math StackExchange (https://math.stackexchange.com)
   - License: CC BY-SA 4.0 (user-contributed content)
   - All training examples are sourced from MSE with full attribution
   - The SFT dataset (data/splits/train.jsonl, data/splits/val.jsonl)
     contains MSE answer IDs, source URLs, and author names for each example

3. IntegralBench Evaluation Dataset
   - Source: IntegralBench project
   - GitHub: https://github.com/IntegralBench/IntegralBench
   - Paper: https://arxiv.org/abs/2507.21130v1
   - Used for evaluation only (not included in this repository)

